{"output":"I’ll inspect authorization, caching, and the existing tests, then patch the isolation bugs and run verification.\n\nProject detail reads lack a membership check, list cache keys omit the organization, and updates leave list caches intact. I’ll fix these in the service and cache-key code, with regression tests for revoked membership, list variants, and organization IDs containing punctuation.\n\nFixed ownership-based authorization for project reads and updates. List caching now isolates organizations, preserves pagination and sorting, and invalidates all affected organization variants without evicting unrelated lists. Cache-hit authorization remains enforced.\n\nAdded regression tests; existing tests unchanged. No dependencies installed.\n\nnpm test: all 11 tests passed, exit 0.\ngit diff --check: passed, exit 0.","final_output":"Fixed ownership-based authorization for project reads and updates. List caching now isolates organizations, preserves pagination and sorting, and invalidates all affected organization variants without evicting unrelated lists. Cache-hit authorization remains enforced.\n\nAdded regression tests; existing tests unchanged. No dependencies installed.\n\nnpm test: all 11 tests passed, exit 0.\ngit diff --check: passed, exit 0.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":24,"tool_calls":[{"name":"skill","status":"success"},{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"git status --short","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-batching-025sltl2/tenant-cache-1-baseline/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":187,"stdout_bytes":0,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-f7619d3cf6adbe281493fe06a0f528fd.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"succe